    "text": "<p>Concentration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math>&nbsp;given is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>001</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>001</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi>OH</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi>OH</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;of the given solution of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math>&nbsp;is 11.</p>"
